{"ts":"2026-09-25T21:16:20.417Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000111","body":{"seq":111,"kind":"tool_request","actor":"agent.claude.child-1","turn":"df4e5acda6bf4f1a9eca5c675c6267db","tool_id":"toolu_01BCE6srBq3C8nCYTJs9URQX","name":"mcp__nimoi__fs_read","arguments":{"path":"origins/onboarding_1.12.md"},"dispatch_valid":true,"stage":"dispatch_validation"}}
